          "type": null,
          "body": "Because field registration is deferred, to get dump_dict to work you need to filter for a wimaxasncp field or dissect it (or print a report from tshark, open up the filter expressions dialog from Wireshark, etc.), e.g.\n\n`WIRESHARK_DUMP_WIMAXASNCP_DICT=1 ./run/tshark -Y wimaxasncp.version -r ~/wireshark/test/captures/empty.pcap`",
